sing another one of your songs.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.390
I love covering your music.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.558
- I love the way you cover my music.

00:00:37.558 --> 00:00:38.633
I think you're and
absolutely wonderful singer

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:41.690
