00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.800
- Oh my gosh, and also
I want to say this too,

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.690
because you not only tweeted
me, after Escapade I died,

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:51.340
when I did Escapade, but
you did something so nice

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.340
